OL,3,GNEWSATeacher 'proud' to see student
OL,4,Acrowned star baker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA food tech teacher says he felt
OL,7,F"really proud" watching a 21-year-old
OL,8,Fformer student be chosen as the first
OL,9,Fstar baker on the new series of the
OL,10,FGreat British Bake Off.
OL,12,FTwelve contestants took on a series of
OL,13,Fculinary challenges in the first
OL,14,Fepisode of the returning Channel 4
OL,15,Fseries on Tuesday, including Mo Mahir,
OL,16,Fa university student in Birmingham.
OL,18,FAfter watching the first episode, his
OL,19,Fold teacher Sam Hayes, from George
OL,20,FSalter Academy in West Bromwich, said:
OL,21,F"When I found out he would be going on,
OL,22,FI knew he would do really well."
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
